Usage / Running the Simulation
Requirements

Python 3.10 or higher (3.11 recommended)

Required package:
pip install numpy
Running the Model
Clone the repository:
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/prmr-framework.git
cd prmr-framework

Run the main simulation:
python prmr.py

What Happens When You Run It

The simulation executes the PRMR model across three domains:

Abstract — baseline, dimensionless system
Physical — cosmological interpretation (Mpc / Gyr)
Cognitive — speculative system (modules / steps)

Each run simulates recursive evolution over multiple cycles.

Simulation Process

At each cycle, the system applies three operators:

Fragmentation
Structures exceeding a critical scale split into smaller units.
Interaction (Gravitational-like)
Structures influence each other based on position and emergent mass.
Nucleation and Merger
Structures either dissipate, grow, or merge into larger structures.
